      },
      "text": "Uyuni, La Paz, Rurrenabaque and San Miguel del Bala"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:b04d5d61d358e759",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "907ae7064ed78ff9a49179be927a99856baf6267fb562e8e2fd019d7aefbbf7c",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261110-51o02k29bbyeytxstzb7f4",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "Transfer to the airport early in the morning. Flights from Uyuni to La Paz and onward to Rurrenabaque are not included.\n\nOn arrival in Rurrenabaque, a staff member will accompany you to the town centre and then to the port. From there, the motorboat ride through Amazonian waterways takes about 45 minutes, mainly along the Beni River.\n\nThe boat takes you to San Miguel del Bala Ecolodge in the Madidi National Park area. After checking in, you have a little free time. A jungle walk with a local guide is planned for the evening.\n\nIncluded: one night at San Miguel del Bala Ecolodge in a shared room with a shared bathroom, transfers along the route, the boat ride and the scheduled jungle walk. Meals: dinner."
    },
